  {id:'woven-light',type:'photo',shape:'photo',title:L('光穿过的地方','Where light passes'),meta:L('照片 / 织物观察','Photograph / textile observation'),media:['mesh.jpg'],alt:L('透光网状织物的细节','Fine translucent woven mesh'),body:L('这里展示的是一张织物照片，而不是把一块布当作万能装饰。另有一条记录对应它的边缘；这层关系在需要时才展开。','This is a photograph of a textile, not a fabric prop added to decorate everything. A separate note records its edge; that relationship is available when needed.')},
  {id:'slow-note',type:'writing',shape:'letter',title:L('慢一点的过程','A slower process'),meta:L('折起的一页短记','A folded note'),excerpt:L('有些想法，\n需要隔一天再看。','Some thoughts\nneed another day.'),body:L('这张纸的折痕属于承载文字的物件。文字本身仍是可选取、可放大的网页文字。它是“关于制作”的延伸，而不是另一个栏目。','The crease belongs to the paper carrying the note. Its words remain selectable, resizable web text. It extends “On making”; it does not need a new website section.')},
  {id:'edge-note',type:'note',shape:'plate',title:L('边缘的处理','On the edge'),meta:L('折面练习的补记','A note on the fold study'),excerpt:L('边缘\n也是表面的一部分。','The edge\nis a surface too.'),body:L('金属牌在这里承载一条短记，不代表网站必须把所有工程内容都做成金属。它与第一页的折面练习相关；跨页的关系用明确链接表达，不拉一条穿过整站的长线。','This metal plate carries one short note. Engineering content does not always need metal styling. Its source is the fold study in the first composition; a clear link expresses that distance without a line across the whole site.')},
  {id:'woven-edge',type:'note',shape:'tracing',title:L('透光的边缘','A translucent edge'),meta:L('同一照片的局部','A detail of the same image'),media:['mesh.jpg'],alt:L('同一张织物照片的局部裁切','A crop from the same textile photograph'),inscription:L('同一张照片，靠近一点。','The same image, a little closer.'),body:L('这张半透明记录使用同一照片的局部裁切，不把它冒充为第二次拍摄。它与织物照片直接关联。','The translucent record uses a crop from the same photograph, not an invented second shoot. It links directly to the textile photograph.')},
  {id:'surface-album',type:'album',shape:'stack',title:L('几个表面','A few surfaces'),meta:L('三张照片 / 一个图集','Three photographs / one collection'),media:['metal.jpg','mesh.jpg','membrane.jpg'],alt:L('金属、织物与暗背景网布的图集','A collection of metal, mesh and dark textile photographs'),body:L('一个图集包含多张媒体，但在首页只占一个内容位置。打开后可以切换照片；独立照片也可以同时属于图集。','A collection contains several media items but occupies one place on the homepage. Open it to move between photographs. An independent photograph can also belong to the collection.')},
  {id:'dark-mesh',type:'photo',shape:'postcard',title:L('暗处的薄片','A thin sheet in the dark'),meta:L('独立照片','Independent photograph'),media:['membrane.jpg'],alt:L('暗背景下的一片细网布','A fine mesh sheet against a dark background'),inscription:L('暗处也有轮廓。','An outline in the dark.'),body:L('独立照片不必为了归类而依附某个项目。图集中收录它，只增加一条“被收录”的关系，不改变它的身份。','An independent photograph does not need to belong to a project. Including it in a collection adds a membership relationship, not a new identity.')},
  {id:'kept-note',type:'note',shape:'indexcard',title:L('留下的痕迹','Traces left behind'),meta:L('短记','Short note'),excerpt:L('记录不必完整，\n但应该知道它指向什么。','A record can be unfinished,\nbut its reference should be clear.'),body:L('这条独立短记没有关联内容。留白就是一种真实状态，不为每一个物件强行制造关系。','This independent note has no linked entries. An absence of connections is a valid state; not every object needs a manufactured relationship.')},
  {id:'unfinished',type:'writing',shape:'text',title:L('未完成的想法','Unfinished thoughts'),meta:L('文字','Writing'),excerpt:L('先留一个位置，让它慢慢长出来。','Leave some room for it to develop.'),body:L('内容扩展不等于每次都改首页构图。新的条目先进入全部内容，再由你决定哪些进入首页、用什么物件来呈现。','Content growth need not redraw the homepage every time. A new entry can first join the full index; you decide whether it belongs on the homepage and which presentation suits it.')}
